            <ArticleTitle>Evaluation of the psychological profiles of patients with signs and symptoms of temporomandibular disorders.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>810-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The psychologic profiles of 98 female patients with signs &amp; symptoms of temporomandibular disorders are compared with those of a control group having no signs or symptoms of such disorders. Scores on the Crown Crisp Experimental Index indicate a significant difference in the profiles of somatization and hysteria.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
